# co_window_sun is a rare window piece.
# Radial glass arcs break up a central open pocket. This changes how the floor connects.
# Its tag and WEIGHT let the controller select it without a file list.
NAME:   co_window_sun
WEIGHT: 3
TAGS:   transparent allow_dup luniq extra serial_co_window_rare
SUBST:  c : ccccm
MAP
xxxx@xxxxxxx@xxxx
xxxx.xxxxxxx.xxxx
xxxx..xxxxx..xxxx
xxxcm...x...mcxxx
@..mcxx.x.xxcm..@
xx..xxx...xxx..xx
xxx.xxccmccxx.xxx
xxx...cmmmc...xxx
xxxxx.mmcmm.xxxxx
xxx...cmmmc...xxx
xxx.xxccmccxx.xxx
xx..xxx...xxx..xx
@..mcxx.x.xxcm..@
xxxcm...x...mcxxx
xxxx..xxxxx..xxxx
xxxx.xxxxxxx.xxxx
xxxx@xxxxxxx@xxxx
ENDMAP
